{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "description": "<h2>Online simple, comprehensive fast and direct access to ilostat data<\/h2> <p>Use left sidebar to choose functionalities and retrieve ILOSTAT data directly or your best statistical software.<\/p><p><b>Example with your browser:<\/b> Annual female youth unemployment rate in United states and France as from 2010 in Excel format with label only<br><a href = \"https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0852_SEX_AGE_RT_A&ref_area=USA+FRA&sex=SEX_F&classif1=AGE_YTHADULT_Y15-24&timefrom=2010&type=label&format=.xlsx\">https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0852_SEX_AGE_RT_A&ref_area=USA+FRA&sex=SEX_F&classif1=AGE_YTHADULT_Y15-24&timefrom=2010&type=label&format=.xlsx<\/a><\/p><p><b>Example with R:<\/b><code><br><\/code><code>library(readr)<\/code><br><code>dat <- read_csv(\"https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0852_SEX_AGE_RT_A&sex=SEX_F&format=.csv\")<br><\/code>or<code><br>dat <- read_rds(\"https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0852_SEX_AGE_RT_A&sex=SEX_F&format=.rds\")<\/code><\/p><p><b>Example with Python:<\/b><br><code>import pandas<br>dat = pandas.read_csv(\"https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0922_NOC_RT_A&ref_area=USA&format=.csv\")<br><\/code>or<code><br>dat = pandas.read_parquet(\"https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0922_NOC_RT_A&ref_area=USA&format=.parquet\")<\/code><\/p><p><b>Example with Stata:<\/b><br><code>webuse set \"https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator\"<\/code><br><code>webuse \"?id=SDG_0552_NOC_RT_A&timefrom=2015&format=.dta\"<\/code><br>or<br><code>import delimited \"https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0552_NOC_RT_A&format=.csv\"<\/code><\/p><p><b>Example with SAS:<\/b><br><code>filename csv url 'https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0922_NOC_RT_A&ref_area=USA';<\/code><br><code>proc import datafile=csv dbms=csv out=want replace;<\/code><br><code>run;<\/code><\/p><br><br><p><table style = \"height:100;width: 100%; vertical-align: middle;horizontal-align: middle;\"><tr><td><br><div align = \"left\"><p><a href=\"https://www.ilo.org\" target = \"blank\" style = \"font-family:Helvetica;color:#b0b9e1;text-decoration: none;\">1996-2025 International Labour Organization (ILO)<\/a><\/p><\/div><br><\/td><td><br><div align = \"center\"><p><a href=\"https://www.ilo.org/global/copyright/lang--en/index.htm\" target = \"blank\" style = \"font-family:Helvetica;color:#b0b9e1;text-decoration: none;\">Copyright & permissions<\/a><a href=\"https://www.ilo.org/global/privacy-policy/lang--en/index.htm\" target = \"blank\" style = \"font-family:Helvetica;color:#b0b9e1;text-decoration: none;\"> | Privacy policy<\/a><a href=\"https://www.ilo.org/global/fraud-alert/lang--/index.htm\" target = \"blank\" style = \"font-family:Helvetica;color:#b0b9e1;text-decoration: none;\"> | Fraud alert<\/a><a href=\"https://www.ilo.org/global/disclaimer/lang--en/index.htm\" target = \"blank\" style = \"font-family:Helvetica;color:#b0b9e1;text-decoration: none;\"> | Disclaimer<\/a><\/p><\/div><br><\/td><td><br><div align = \"right\"><p><a href=\"https://ilostat.github.io/Rilostat/\" target = \"blank\" style = \"font-family:Helvetica;color:#b0b9e1;text-decoration: none;\">Powered by Rilostat<\/a><a href=\"https://ilostat.ilo.org/about/contact/\" target = \"blank\" style = \"font-family:Helvetica;color:#b0b9e1;text-decoration: none;\"> | Contact us<\/a><\/p><\/div><br><\/td><\/tr><\/table><\/p>",
    "title": "ilostat web service",
    "version": "1.0.1"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/data/indicator": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "/data/indicator-GET",
        "summary": "get datasets by indicator_freqency",
        "description": "<b>example:<\/b> https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/indicator?id=SDG_0852_SEX_AGE_RT_A&ref_area=USA+FRA&sex=SEX_F&classif1=AGE_YTHADULT_YGE15+AGE_YTHADULT_Y15-24&timefrom=2010&format=.csv",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "Default response."
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "lang",
            "description": "<b>see also:<\/b> fr, es  ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "en"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "id",
            "description": "<b>up to 3 see also:<\/b> <a href=\"./#get-/metadata/toc/indicator\">/metadata/toc/indicator<\/a>  ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "SDG_0111_SEX_AGE_RT_A"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "format",
            "description": "<b>see also:<\/b> .csv2, .tsv, .csv.gz, .rds, .dta, .sav, .xpt, .json, .xlsx, .feather, .parquet    ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": ".csv"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "ref_area",
            "description": "<b>see also:<\/b> <a href=\"./#get-/metadata/dic/\">/metadata/dic?var=ref_area<\/a>  ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "source",
            "description": "<b>see also:<\/b> <a href=\"./#get-/metadata/dic/\">/metadata/dic?var=source<\/a>  ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sex",
            "description": "<b>see also:<\/b> <a href=\"./#get-/metadata/dic/\">/metadata/dic?var=sex<\/a>  ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "classif1",
            "description": "<b>see also:<\/b> <a href=\"./#get-/metadata/dic/\">/metadata/dic?var=classif1<\/a>  ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "classif2",
            "description": "<b>see also:<\/b> <a href=\"./#get-/metadata/dic/\">/metadata/dic?var=classif2<\/a>",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "time",
            "description": "<b>4 characters for year only, ie: 2024",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "timefrom",
            "description": "<b>4 characters for stating year only, ie: 2010",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "timeto",
            "description": "<b>4 characters for ending year only, ie: 2020",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "latestyear",
            "description": "<b>characters for getting latest year per ref_area, indicator, ie: TRUE",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "FALSE"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "best_source",
            "description": "\\code{\"yes\"} (default) to get secondary source if exist \\code{\"all\"}, \\code{\"no\"} for secondary only.",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "yes"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "type",
            "description": "code <b>see also:<\/b> label, both",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "code"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "region",
            "description": "<b>available :<\/b> AMERICAS, \"AFRICA, ROAS, ROAP, ROECA ",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "mode",
            "description": "currently B for best source only <b>soon also:<\/b> S for summary table and F for full records",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "channel",
            "description": "internal",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "title",
            "description": "internal",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "cmd",
            "description": "deprecated",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "none"
            }
          }
        ],
        "tags": ["data"]
      }
    },
    "/data/ref_area": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "/data/ref_area-GET",
        "summary": "get datasets by ref_area_freqency",
        "description": "<b>example:<\/b> https://rplumber.ilo.org/data/ref_area?id=AFG_A&indicator=UNE_TUNE_SEX_AGE_NB+EMP_TEMP_SEX_AGE_NB&classif1=AGE_YTHADULT_Y15-24&timefrom=2010&format=.csv",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK"
